  "text": "Lexar Announces New NM760 M.2 2280 PCIe Gen4x4 NVMe SSD | Lexar Lexar / News / Lexar Announces New NM760 M.2 2280 PCIe Gen4x4 NVMe SSD May 16, 2022 Lexar Announces New NM760 M.2 2280 PCIe Gen4x4 NVMe SSD Share Key Features: Experience high-speed PCIe NVMe Gen 4×4 performance: 5300MB/s read, 4500MB/s write speed 1 – supports NVMe 1.4, with M.2 2280 form facto Get 9.6x 3 faster than a SATA-based SSD Developed with the 12nm controller for lower power consumption Enjoy the coolness with an optional added heatsink Wide range of compatibility: compatible with PlayStation ® 5, notebooks and PCs Shock and vibration resistant with no moving parts 2 Five-year limited warranty San Jose, USA, May 16, 2022 –Lexar, a leading global brand of flash memory solution, is excited to announce the new Lexar® NM760 M.2 2280 PCIe Gen4x4 NVMe SSD. Especially designed for gamers and professionals with faster speeds and more computing power. The Lexar® NM760 M.2 2280 PCIe Gen4x4 NVMe SSD allows you to enjoy a high-speed gaming experience with speeds of up to 5300MB/s read and 4500MB/s write1. It is a PCIe NVMe SSD which is 9.6×3 the performance compared to traditional SATA based SSD. Leveraging PCIe Gen4x4 NVMe 1.4 technology standard to ensure faster and smoother gaming experience, the NM760 is also backward compatible with PCIe 3.0. The Lexar® NM760 M.2 2280 NVMe SSD is also widely compatible with notebooks, PC, and even your PlayStation® 5, delivering powerful performance for high-speed storage backup and access to content. With an optional heatsink, you can unleash the outstanding performance and enjoy high-performance while keeping your SSD cool. “The Lexar® NM760 M.2 2280 NVMe SSD is a high-speed gaming SSD that delivers a superior performance, making it a great choice for PC enthusiasts, professionals who want to upgrade their system.” said Joel Boquiren, General Manager of Lexar. Lexar® NM760 M.2 2280 NVMe SSD is available xxx for purchase online at an MSRP of xxx. The NM760 will be available in the U.S. in 2H 2022. All Lexar product designs undergo extensive testing in the Lexar Quality Labs, facilities with more than 1,100 digital devices, to ensure performance, quality, compatibility, and reliability. For more information visit www.lexar.com 1 Up to 5300MB/s read transfer. Write transfer speed lower. Speed based on internal testing. Actual performance may vary. 2 Shock resistant (1500G, duration 0.5ms, Half Sine Wave) and vibration resistant (10~2000Hz, 1.5mm, 20G, 1 Oct/min, 30min/axis(X,Y,Z)). Based on internal testing. Actual performance may vary. 3 Comparison based on internal testing. Actual performance may vary. *Security safeguards, by their nature, are capable of circumvention. Lexar does not guarantee data will be 100% secure from unauthorized access, alteration, or destruction. *Actual usable memory capacity may vary. 1GB equals 1 billion bytes. *Product appearance, performance, software offerings, and packaging may vary depending on ship date and available inventory. *Lexar is not liable for any loss of data or images. Media Elements Press Images (Desktop Only) Product Information About Lexar For more than 25 years, Lexar has been a trusted leading global brand of memory solutions. Our award-winning lineup includes memory cards, USB flash drives, card readers, solid-state drives and DRAM. With so many options, it’s easy to find the right Lexar solution to fit your needs. All Lexar product designs undergo extensive testing in the Lexar Quality Labs with more than 1,100 digital devices, to ensure performance, quality, compatibility, and reliability. Lexar products are available worldwide at major retail and e-tail stores. For more information or support, visit www.lexar.com . About Longsys Longsys – a leader in consumer NAND flash applications, is committed to supporting Lexar in its quest to reach new achievements in high-performance, quality, and reliability while maintaining its position as a leading global brand in memory cards, USB flash drives, readers, and storage drives for retail and OEM customers. Instagram: instagram.com/lexarmemory Twitter: twitter.com/lexarmemory Facebook: facebook.com/lexarmemory YouTube: youtube.com/c/LexarMemoryOfficial Lexar. 161 Baypointe Pkwy, San Jose, CA 95134, United States Media Contact: Joey Lopez Senior Marketing Manager [email protected] You may also like Oct 23, 2026 Lexar Launches the SILVER GO microSDXC Card V30 rating provides seamless 4K 60fps recording  SAN JOSE, Calif. (Oct. 22, 2026) – Lexar, a global leader in memory and storage, today announced the new Lexar® Professional SILVER GO microSDXC™ UHS-I Card, a versatile storage solution designed for videographers, gamers and creators who need reliable, high-performance storage across their favorite portable devices with microSD […] Read More Sep 08, 2026 Lexar Unveils Muse, the World’s Thinnest Portable SSD, at IFA 2026 Lexar marks its 30th anniversary by introducing the world’s thinnest portable SSD, and showcases their line-up of next generation AI storage technologies at IFA 2026 BERLIN, Germany — September 4, 2026 — Lexar, a global leader in memory and storage solutions, today unveiled its latest storage innovations at IFA 2026, led by the new Lexar […] Read More Click outside to hide the comparison bar Compare Selection EN ES",
